content:
The crypto industry has had an almost perfect night so far when it comes to backing winning candidates.

@KenPaxtonTX, backed by @Fellowship_PAC, defeated @JohnCornyn in the Republican Senate primary runoff.

@RepCDMenefee and @JonBonckTX also won after receiving support from @Fairshake and @BlockchainLF.

Fairshake-backed candidates @AlexMealerTX and @SellForTexas19 also won their respective races, while @CarlosForTexas is currently projected to win.

